{"id":"vod_md_5534","vodId":"5534","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"迷茫管家与懦弱的我","name_cn":"迷茫管家与懦弱的我","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231001-1/e7958a5ee69c44ebd7a55bd394889f47.jpg"},"summary":"近卫昂（井口裕香 配音）家世世代代都作为凉月家的管家而存在，以此与凉月家族形成了深厚的羁绊。可是，管家的职位只能由男子担当，为了延续祖先的传统，近卫昂女扮男装隐藏身份，成为了大小姐凉月奏（喜多村英梨 配音）的管家。坂町近次郎是一个普通的男生，由于童年的遭遇，长大后的次郎开始变得无法从容的面对女性，这一现象一般被称为“女性恐惧症”。由于这种特质，次郎发现了近卫昂的秘密，为了掩盖事实，凉月奏以治疗其恐惧症为条件，要求次郎保守这个秘密。从此，在害怕女性的次郎身边，开始出没大量外形可爱性格活泼的女生，次郎快乐的校园生活正式开始！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-01 07:20:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/lHvnK3A7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/eEd7BlM2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/brt3FAUW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/d3yuziaW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/tPjiZsHt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/fSbxZiSS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/jdAAcd3u/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/VM1MvZLp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/8rZEm9DE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/emjASgeZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/PjV5HaJ3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/e7Vp71wk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/4jPyMAKO/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:54.542Z"}